@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<div class="text-center mb-4">
    <h1 class="display-4">Trailside Photography Lessons</h1>
    <p class="lead">I help hikers capture dramatic mountain light with simple, repeatable camera settings.</p>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <img class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm hobby-image" src="~/images/mountain-sunrise.svg" alt="Mountain sunrise scene" />
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <img class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm hobby-image" src="~/images/forest-trail.svg" alt="Forest trail with camera" />
    </div>
</div>

<section class="mt-4">
    <p>
        Trail photography combines endurance with creativity. My favorite part is finding a quiet overlook, then
        waiting for the light to wash over the ridgeline. I keep my kit lightweight and focus on a few reliable
        settings that make it easy to capture crisp, vibrant shots even when the weather changes fast.
    </p>
    <p>
        When I am not hiking, I teach others how to compose shots on the trail, balance exposure, and keep their
        gear protected. We talk through safe routes, how to read the light, and how to tell a story with a single
        image so every hike ends with a gallery worth sharing.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Calculator">Calculate tutoring cost</a>
    </div>
</section>
